02:26.600 --> 02:27.400
Your Highness.

02:27.400 --> 02:28.720
Why are you staring at me?

02:29.680 --> 02:30.840
I didn't mean

02:31.600 --> 02:32.920
I didn't mean it.

02:33.400 --> 02:34.440
