04:43.440 --> 04:44.360
Your Highness.

04:44.360 --> 04:45.320
Help.

04:45.320 --> 04:46.159
Raise your hand.

05:09.960 --> 05:10.760
Are you done, Your Highness?

05:13.600 --> 05:14.400
Your Highness.

05:18.560 --> 05:19.360
Your Highness.

05:25.680 --> 05:26.480
Young Master.

05:26.680 --> 05:28.360
